WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Read. Start with ten cluster-ranked report rows and documented city aggregates.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Compare. Display relative risk separately from original rank and facility counts.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Animate. Compare A/B/C indicators as alternative scenarios, not as a forecast movie.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Interpret. Read 3D height as relative risk; it is not terrain or floodwater depth.
